sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Co as Coordinator
    participant W as Workers (x1000)
    Note over Co,W: mode — two rounds, exact
    Co->>W: scan your own partition
    W-->>Co: top-m local values with counts, plus the partition total
    Co->>Co: bound each candidate's global count — prune anything that cannot win
    Co->>W: broadcast the surviving candidate set
    W-->>Co: exact count of every candidate over the full partition
    Co->>Co: sum, argmax, deterministic tie-break
    Note over Co,W: median — binary search the value domain, not the items
    Co->>W: pivot or bucket boundaries
    W-->>Co: count(< pivot), count(== pivot)
    Co->>Co: recurse into the side containing k
